<section class="band fade" id="process" aria-labelledby="proc-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">II &nbsp;—&nbsp; How we work</span>
      <h2 id="proc-h">Three steps. No <i>fluorescent</i> lights.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Independent does not mean improvised. Every client moves through the same three moments. What fills each one is yours alone.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="process-list">
      <li class="process-step process-step--lead">
        <div class="process-marker">
          <span class="process-num">01</span>
          <span class="process-meta">First meeting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="process-body">
          <h3 class="process-title">A <i>conversation,</i> not a pitch.</h3>
          <p class="process-prose">We meet at the office, on a video call, or by phone. No deck. No commitment. No rotating account team running interference. We talk about what you're working toward and what's actually in the way of it.</p>
          <p class="process-aside">Twenty minutes, usually. Mornings work best.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="process-step">
        <div class="process-marker">
          <span class="process-num">02</span>
          <span class="process-meta">If we're a fit</span>
        </div>
        <div class="process-body">
          <h3 class="process-title">A written <i>plan.</i></h3>
          <p class="process-prose">Investments, retirement, tax coordination, insurance, estate. Addressed in one document, not a stack of brochures. Built around your situation, not a model portfolio you happen to fit.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="process-step">
        <div class="process-marker">
          <span class="process-num">03</span>
          <span class="process-meta">From there on</span>
        </div>
        <div class="process-body">
          <h3 class="process-title">A long <i>partnership.</i></h3>
          <p class="process-prose">Quarterly check-ins. Annual reviews. A phone that gets picked up the same day. The plan adjusts as your life does, not the other way around.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap"><div class="rule-band" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
